Hong Kong unilaterally waives visa requirements for Cambodia
Phnom Penh: Hong Kong has unilaterally agreed to grant visa exemptions to holders of official and diplomatic passports from Cambodia from June so that Cambodian officials and diplomats can enter and leave a commercial city. This has never been easier.
