Officials at the Ministry of Industry, Mines and Energy have organized annual awards for small and medium-sized enterprises in Cambodia to improve the quality of local products as the Commonwealth Economic Community approaches.
This annual award will be given to any enterprise that complies with the five criteria, including clean, tidy, clean, standard and stable, known as Disk 5.
