Surgical instruments and machines imported from Germany.
Other devices are imported from Japan.
The hospital is hygienic, modern and high-tech.
For Dr. Tith, the secret of becoming a child who walks, catching fish and crabs and living in a palm-leaf hut in the jungle to become the manager of a state-of-the-art dental hospital is a daunting task. Grow on your own from day to day.
His hospital is ISO certified and all Roomchang staff are taught the importance of the following procedures.
All staff must follow and we will open training for new staff.
Dr. Tith started working as a dentist for the first time in 1996.
Since that day, his business has grown by 40 percent.
Many of his patients are from Australia, New Zealand, Europe and the United States, emphasizing Dr. Tith's vision of dental tourism, where people can visit Cambodia and receive first-class services at the lowest possible prices. In some developed countries.
He said with a smile:
We work hard for a little money.
The maximum fee comes from the customer.
Dr. Tith said his confidence stemmed from his difficult life.
If you are a surgeon, if you do not have confidence, you will die.
Confidence is the foundation of success.
